Read Psalm 24, Daniel 9

Let us humble ourselves and enter His throne of grace, before the Ancient of Days Who wields the authority for His Kingdom to come upon our nation. The prayer in Daniel 9 provides the blueprint for break-through, engaging heavenly realms powerfully until angelic intervention brought about the fulfilment of God’s promises for Israel! Daniel’s life was marked by true humility and wholehearted obedience to God - a life of consecration, submission, dependence, endurance and perseverance. His powerful life of prayer was soaked in humility and understanding of Who God was. May this be our heart’s cry as we prepare towards 70 years of Merdeka in 2027!

As we enter into God’s defining time for Malaysia, let’s consecrate ourselves in fervent prayer and diligently apply these principles and attitudes to unlock His purposes for our nation! On this Malaysia Day, let us Welcome the Ancient of Days and declare Psalm 24:1–2, 7–10!

The earth is the Lord’s, and everything in it, the world, and all who live in it;
for He founded it on the seas and established it on the waters. (NIV)
